.TH RPCS3 1 "2026-08-05" "rpcs3 0.0.42" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
rpcs3 \- Sony PlayStation 3 emulator and debugger
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rpcs3
.RI [ options ]
.RI [ path ]
.RI [ \-\- " emulation-arguments" ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B rpcs3
emulates the Sony PlayStation 3. It recompiles the Cell Broadband Engine's PPU
and SPU code through LLVM and renders the RSX graphics processor through Vulkan
or OpenGL, and it carries a debugger for both processors.
.PP
Given a
.I path
to a bootable executable (typically an
.B EBOOT.BIN
inside a dumped title), that title is booted directly; with no path the
graphical interface starts.
.PP
Arguments following a bare
.B \-\-
are passed through to the emulated program rather than interpreted by
.BR rpcs3 .
.SS Firmware is not included
.B rpcs3
cannot boot anything without PlayStation 3 system firmware. That firmware,
distributed by Sony as
.BR PS3UPDAT.PUP ,
is copyrighted and is
.B not
shipped with this package and not downloaded by it. Obtain it yourself from
Sony and install it with
.B \-\-installfw
or through the emulator's
.I File / Install Firmware
dialog. The same applies to game software: only titles you have dumped from
media you own are expected.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-headless
Run without any window, for automated or remote use.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-gui
Run without the graphical interface, booting the given title directly.
.TP
.B \-\-fullscreen
Run games fullscreen. Only used together with
.BR \-\-no\-gui .
.TP
.BI \-\-game\-screen " index"
Place the game window on the numbered screen.
.TP
.BI \-\-hidpi " enabled"
Enable Qt high-DPI scaling. Defaults to 1.
.TP
.BI \-\-dpi\-rounding " rounding"
Set the Qt high-DPI scale-factor rounding policy, for zoom levels such as 150%.
Defaults to 4.
.TP
.B \-\-styles
List the available interface styles and exit.
.TP
.BI \-\-style " style"
Load a named interface style.
.TP
.BI \-\-stylesheet " path"
Load a custom stylesheet.
.TP
.BI \-\-config " path"
Use this configuration file for the title booted from the command line.
.TP
.BI \-\-input\-config " name"
Use this input configuration for the title booted from the command line.
.TP
.BI \-\-installfw " path"
Install the given PlayStation 3 firmware file. See
.B Firmware is not included
above.
.TP
.BI \-\-installpkg " path"
Install the given PKG file.
.TP
.BI \-\-decrypt " path"
Decrypt the given PS3 binaries.
.TP
.BI \-\-user\-id " id"
Start as this emulated user.
.TP
.BI \-\-savestate " path"
Load a savestate directly.
.TP
.BI \-\-last\-savestate " title-id"
Load the most recent savestate of a title, by title ID or path.
.TP
.BI \-\-rsx\-capture " path"
Load an RSX capture directly.
.TP
.B \-\-qDebug
Write Qt debug output to RPCS3.log.
.TP
.BI \-\-high\-res\-timer " enabled"
Enable the high-resolution timer. Has an effect on Windows only; accepted here
for command-line compatibility. Defaults to 1.
.TP
.B \-\-verbose\-curl
Log libcurl activity verbosely.
.TP
.B \-\-allow\-any\-location
Permit running from any directory. Upstream marks this dangerous.
.TP
.B \-\-codecs
List the available ffmpeg codecs and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-error
.TQ
.B \-\-updating
Reserved for internal use by the emulator's own relaunch and update paths.
.TP
.B \-h ", " \-\-help
Show the built-in usage summary and exit.
.TP
.B \-v ", " \-\-version
Show the version and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/rpcs3/
Configuration, including per-title configuration files.
.TP
.I ~/.cache/rpcs3/
Shader and PPU/SPU recompiler caches.
.TP
.I /usr/share/rpcs3/
Icons and default GUI configurations shipped with the package.
.SH NOTES
This package is built against the distribution's LLVM, ffmpeg, OpenCV, SDL3,
OpenAL, libcurl, libpng, libusb, zlib and zstd rather than the copies upstream
vendors. It is also built without
.BR \-march=native ,
so it runs on any x86-64 host rather than only on the machine that built it.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR pcsx2 (1),
.BR ppsspp (1),
.BR xemu (1)
.PP
Compatibility lists, configuration guides and the quick-start documentation are
at
.UR https://rpcs3.net
.UE .
